(LEGAL-025 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu WRD Technical Circular No. WRD/CE-PF/14/2018  Maintenance of Ta) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Assistant Engineer / Junior Engineer \(WRD Irrigation Section\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Clause 4.1 \(Leak-Proof Sluice Shutters to Prevent Premature Drying\)) Tj T*
(Broken or corroded cast-iron/steel sluice shutters \( \) and missing) Tj T*
(screw-gearing rods cause continuous dead-storage leakage and premature tank drying) Tj T*
(before the Samba/Navarai harvest. Assistant Engineers \(WRD\) must inspect all tank) Tj T*
(sluices in August and repair leaking shutters within 15 days of receipt of a) Tj T*
(farmer or WUA complaint.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Clause 4.3 \(Prohibition on IllegalRaising of Surplus Weir Crest\)) Tj T*
(No person shall place unauthorized concrete blocks, sandbags, or earthen bunds) Tj T*
(above the designed crest level of a tank surplus weir \(\), as raising FTL) Tj T*
(submerges foreshore patta lands and endangers the earthen tank bund.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
